#### pitfalls/

**命名**：`PIT-NNN.md`（递增编号）。

```markdown
---
id: PIT-NNN
object_type: pitfall
lifecycle: knowledge
owner: [发现者角色]
status: active
severity: blocker|warning|info
type: backend|frontend|db|deploy|process|env
summary: "一句话描述此陷阱"
verified_commit: abc123
confidence: verified
---

